silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_05_probe_ungated_render_concrete_anchor_4#validatedclaimshaclpassed silm:hasLongDescription "The ValidatedClaimSHACLPassed is ValidatedClaim is the fourth node in the R5 pipeline. For the Mittens fixture, MeasurementEvent2024 passes the SHACL shape MeasurementEventShape (mass-must-be-positive, date-must-parse-as-ISO8601, quality-must-be-BodyMassQuality). Only after this validation can the render arrow fire on the claim; an unvalidated typed claim is still ungated for proof-surface rendering." .
